date: 2025-08-28T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Horizon is [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]'s public tram system, run by [[Prime Meridian]]. It is the only way to cross between the city's districts, since the magic of [[the Host]] enforces the boundaries and will not let a person simply walk from one to the next. A single route threads the city from the starward end to the voidward end, with stops along the way: Star 12 on the starward side, the Void 1 and Void 2 stops toward the factories, and [[Prime (Zero)]] at the center. Trams materialize at the platform with a soft chime.
